// 4️⃣ Sky + fog
map.setSky({
  'sky-color': '#87CEEB',
  'sky-horizon-blend': 0.5,
  'horizon-color': '#FFFFFF',
  'fog-color': '#B0C4DE',
  'horizon-fog-blend': 0.4,
  'fog-ground-blend': 0.3
});
```

Run it after `map.on('load')` and you’ll have a proper sky with a gentle haze that blends into the terrain.

